).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-cc16dc22-a97f-465f-a20c-1fddfd15743a" endid="#m-d4f58932-8b35-41fc-9d81-44ea09845507" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((inexausta))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((inexaustat)), lies ((inexhausta)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-b0c88024-3abe-41f4-b8d6-7aaa7674aeb8" endid="#m-0c9687f8-40a2-44fb-95cb-cd41034ab1d7" corresp="#m-comment-13"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-13-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation ungenau, dem Eindruck nach</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-13-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(alles folgende eine Stufe höher), die Edition orientiert sich an 5b.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-61b9cacb-08b7-4dc3-b98d-80b4dd4187cd" endid="#m-68b397ab-3796-4920-bfd0-096789900a87"><table><tr><td><rend>((tacta))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>semantisch plausibler: ((tanta)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-e27e609b-60db-4717-b171-5b637dd0a916" endid="#m-831f34b9-aa02-45b8-a06e-c2af305c8497" corresp="#m-comment-15"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-15-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation nicht sicher lesbar wegen Wasserfleck.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-2757b8c8-51d5-4ab2-bbbc-77593fa44c74" endid="#m-8adb19c2-189c-4855-8814-06de1c612032" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((merita)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((merito))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-8dbf9201-c092-4bb9-bad2-325e00a6d9a6" endid="#m-5923084b-7893-43c2-b1d9-4a20aad61b6b" corresp="#m-comment-17"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-17-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Notation ungenau, dem Eindruck nach</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-17-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(alles Folgende eine Stufe höher), die Edition orientiert sich an 6a.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4